  - m_Id: 2413976309760
    m_Localized: "Select a combatant and send a stream of Kuroy\u016B toward it.
      If it is an ally, it hardens and gains X% physical defense for 3 turns. If
      it is an enemy, its physical defense is reduced by X% and it takes magic damage
      for 3 turns.\n\nX = 10% + (100 \u2212 Magic Power)%"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2450995236864
    m_Localized: "Spread a Kuroy\u016B area across the battlefield. The central allied
      combatant moves forward 1 slot in the turn order, while the left and right
      enemy combatants each move back 1 slot."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2619652395008
    m_Localized: "Renjiro transforms the battlefield, enveloping it in his Kuroy\u016B.
      For 2 rounds, allied combatants recover 15 Energy per turn and their damage
      increases by 15%."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
